ZAINAB NE KAHA LAUT KEY MAIDAN SE NA AANA<br>
AYE AOUN-O-MOHAMMED MERE WADE KO NIBHANA<br>
<br>
JAFFER KE JIGAR BAND HO HYDER KI NAZAR HO<br>
SHAGIRD-E-ALAMDAR HO ZAINAB KEY PISAR HO<br>
DADA KI TARAH JUNG MEIN, TALWAR CHALANA<br>
<br>
TUM SHARE HO JARRAR HO KARRAR HO PYARO<br>
MAMU KI TARAH TUM BHI WAFADAR HO PYARO<br>
PYASE HO MAGAR BHUL KEY, DARYA PE NA JANA<br>
<br>
MADAR KI NASIYATH KO SADA DHIYAN MEIN RAKHNA<br>
PAANI KABHI PEENE KA BHI ARMAN NA KARNA<br>
PYASE HAI TEEN ROZ KEY, ASGHAR WO SAKINA<br>
<br>
MAI SOUNCHTI THI WAQT PADE JAB BHI AQI PAR<br>
KARDUNGI FIDA TUMKO MEIN AULADE ALI PAR<br>
JIS TARAH SE HO DEENE, MUHAMMED KO BACHANA<br>
<br>
FOUJEY SHAQI NEY GHERA HEIN FARZAND-E-NABI KO<br>
ALLAH SALAMATH RAKHEY DUNIYA MEIN AQI KO<br>
TUM DONO MERE BHAI PE, JAAN APNI LUTANA<br>
<br>
GHODEY SE GIREIN RUN MEIN JO HYDER KEY NAWASE<br>
ZAQMOUN SEY CHUR CHUR THEY MAZHAR WO DULHARE<br>
TA HASHAR MEIN YE YAAD, RAKHEGA YE ZAMANA
